			"notes": "<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"loaders overload_png_final\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07f4a672-e7f7-4b06-ab8c-aa3c5b195747\" />\n\n\n\n## Versions / Loaders support   \n\n|          | 1.18.2 | 1.19.2 | 1.20.1 | 1.21.1 |\n|----------|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Forge    |   ✅    |   ✅    |   ✅    |        |\n| Neoforge |        |        |        |   ✅    |\n| Fabric   |   ✅    |   ✅    |   ✅    |   ✅    |\n\n## New features / fixes\n\n* Added dropping plate with content when broken with Silk Touch,...;\n* ...OR when broken with End rod or Sponges using pistons (configrable tag);\n* Added dispenser placing functionality (with Quark support...hopefully, I fixed it, like, three times);\n* Added comparator support (needs block update after capacity change in config);\n* Cats now don't break fragile plates;\n* [1.21.1] Added two tags for food/drink containers to prevent food in bowls and drinks from getting on plate;\n* Fixed One Tray advancement not triggering from inventory interactions;\n* Fixed vanilla gold tags potentially broken by previous releases. Oops;\n* Touched up plate model UV.\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/V972/dinnerwareMod/compare/1.0.0...1.1.0"
